{"id":"steam-5550400","steam":5550400,"igdb":null,"type":"dlc","title":"Desktop Familiar - Lively Personality Pack","summary":"Adds the Lively personality to Haru, featuring energetic chatterbox lines and animations, exclusive scenes, and two Korean voice sets. Requires the base game, Desktop Familiar.","about":"Lively personality\n\r\n\nLively Haru is an energetic chatterbox. She dances around the screen, chats with you often, and shares the latest news.\n\r\n\nWhat's included\n\r\n\n\r\n• Lines and reactions for the Lively personality (talk frequency, tone, head-pat reactions, and more)\r\n• Over 70 exclusive scenes, including pushing windows around for fun and tumbling over with a laugh\r\n• Two Korean voice sets (choose Voice 1 or Voice 2 in Settings)\r\n\n\r\n\nYou can switch personalities in Settings at any time. In English, Japanese, or Chinese, her lines appear in speech bubbles.\n\r\n\nRequires the base game, Desktop Familiar. The voices were generated in advance with AI speech synthesis.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5550400/cb70a9b5ede9d54fb4188b8fef59a4471fbc6569/capsule_616x353.jpg?t=1795704168","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5550400/8e34f696098b90994588a01bf9cdfa57f82b2882/header.jpg?t=1795704168","banner":null,"header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5550400/8e34f696098b90994588a01bf9cdfa57f82b2882/header.jpg?t=1795704168","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5550400/1ba88e2eac3917a736cadea01b24f8e3fa4bf0f4/ss_1ba88e2eac3917a736cadea01b24f8e3fa4bf0f4.600x338.jpg?t=1795704168","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5550400/1ba88e2eac3917a736cadea01b24f8e3fa4bf0f4/ss_1ba88e2eac3917a736cadea01b24f8e3fa4bf0f4.jpg?t=1795704168"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5550400/2a5